      "excerpt": "Powering Change: Inspiring Success Stories from Free Electrons 2022 Cohort Alumni - Free Electrons Skip to content HOME PROGRAM 2027 Program Categories FAQS PARTNERS ALUMNI Our Alumni Startup of the year Akimoto Award ABOUT US News Research Ecosystem CONTACT Home PROGRAM Categories FAQS PARTNERS ALUMNI Startup of the year Akimoto Award RESEARCH Ecosystem News CONTACT Apply now Success Stories Powering Change: Inspiring Success Stories from Free Electrons 2022 Cohort Alumni August 14, 2023 freeelectrons.admin The Free Electrons program has been a driving force behind the clean energy transition, bringing together startups and leading energy utilities to create a sustainable future. In the 2022 cohort, we witnessed remarkable success stories from some outstanding startups that have reshaped the energy landscape. In this blog post, we shine a spotlight on three inspiring alumni from the 2022 cohort: Power to Hydrogen, Simerse AI, and Brainbox AI. These startups have not only achieved significant milestones but are also paving the way for a greener and more efficient energy industry. Power to Hydrogen Power to Hydrogen is revolutionizing the production and storage of hydrogen, a key component in the clean energy transition. Through their innovative electrolysis technology, they have developed an efficient and sustainable method for generating hydrogen from renewable sources. With"
